hting against a massive power that plans to reintigrate them into the whole. Spycraft wages in British teritories, as the Continental army struggles to hold the line. What is more important to you; liberty or your freedom?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T08:54:48-07:00","id":903580,"title":"","content":"- Spanish Civil War Vampire Geist<br /> - Sumerian Werewolf expanded and updated to 2nd edition<br /> - Roman Mages with a great sidebar updating Requiem for Rome to 2nd edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T10:04:44-07:00","id":903623,"title":"","content":"All of the Eras which we didn't got during the Kickstarter, plus the Punic Wars as Hunter/Demon Era, Scramble for Africa as a Mage Era, Golden Age of Islam, Renaissance for Inferno and the Roman Empire as a crossover Era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T10:20:10-07:00","id":903632,"title":"","content":"I think a Beast setting in Ancient Greece would be absolutely stellar, exploring Horrors that we recognize as the great mythological monsters and Heroes that openly operate with apparent divine favor. <br /> <br /> One thing I did find lacking in Dark Eras was that the crossiver settings didn't actually crossover that much, instead acting as Eras shared by bith gamelines but not directly interacting. It would be great to see Eras aimed specifically at crossover play, or maybe even an antagonistic setup; I've been toying with tossing Hunters or Changelings into my 1860s Mage setting as playable opposition.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uxas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903580#post903580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- Spanish Civil War Vampire Geist<br /> - Sumerian Werewolf expanded and updated to 2nd edition<br /> - Roman Mages with a great sidebar updating Requiem for Rome to 2nd edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be ecstatic to see Roman Mage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T10:31:58-07:00","id":903641,"title":"","content":"Filipino-American War. Changeling and/or Mage Chronicle? Mentioning this because I remember that this era was considered as a possible setting for an Assassin's Creed game.<br /> <br /> I'm also game for both Roman Mage <i>and</i> an expansion of Hunting Ground: Sumer. But the latter might end up being covered as an extension of my Age of Azar project, and/or <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4152\" data-vbnamecard=\"4152\">Arcanist</a>'s Sundered World Chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":8180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","user":"Deionscribe","date":". 05-30-2016, 01:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T10:38:39-07:00","id":903647,"title":"","content":"Hmm... Am I the only one thinking that 1650's Poland Changeling would be a good idea? Yes? Well it does fit pretty nice together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T10:54:19-07:00","id":903658,"title":"","content":"Thinking about it, a Golden Age of Piracy setting would be good; I'm think Mage/Demon, but Mage/anything would work. Mage because this setting was explicitly described in the teasers for the Mage 2e and apparently briefly expanded upon; this era apparently had the Silver Ladder and the Seers allying to deal with a alliance of Nameless centered around a &quot;pirate republic&quot; who had figured out how to cancel Atlantean Symbols. Demon both because a Demon Car'd pirate ship is an awesome idea and because that thing with the pirates and Nameless sounds like a very Unchained thing to do; maybe represent the Nameless and an Agency in alliance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T11:06:12-07:00","id":903662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903658#post903658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thinking about it, a Golden Age of Piracy setting would be good; I'm think Mage/Demon, but Mage/anything would work. Mage because this setting was explicitly described in the teasers for the Mage 2e and apparently briefly expanded upon; this era apparently had the Silver Ladder and the Seers allying to deal with a alliance of Nameless centered around a &quot;pirate republic&quot; who had figured out how to cancel Atlantean Symbols. Demon both because a Demon Car'd pirate ship is an awesome idea and because that thing with the pirates and Nameless sounds like a very Unchained thing to do; maybe represent the Nameless and an Agency in alliance?</div> </div> </div> </div>Golden Age of Piracy has to be at least half Geist; the crazy blend of Catholic and West African beliefs with new naval superstitions and folklore give birth to a unique cobbled-together mythology that feels right at home to the Bound, and there's certainly no shortage of ways to die at sea. You get the Flying Dutchman sailing with her drowned sails and you have Blackbeard swimming around his ship with his head cut off due to his dabbling in black magic; it's perfect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 05-30-2016, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T11:56:36-07:00","id":903692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inquisitor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903647#post903647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... Am I the only one thinking that 1650's Poland Changeling would be a good idea? Yes? Well it does fit pretty nice together.</div> </div> </div> </div>You made me interested - but I still do not see this as 1650's setting would be very folk tale - and 2E Changeling sounds much more... political one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T12:12:19-07:00","id":903703,"title":"","content":"I literally have a full list of 26 settings I will post this evening","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T12:15:16-07:00","id":903706,"title":"","content":"You're both wrong for the record, the obvious space opera Dark Era is to go Battlestar Galactica. Fifth Turn Mummy following signs and prophesy seeking A'aru among the literal stars in a Biblical pilgrimage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T12:20:56-07:00","id":903709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903706#post903706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're both wrong for the record, the obvious space opera Dark Era is to go Battlestar Galactica. Fifth Turn Mummy following signs and prophesy seeking A'aru among the literal stars in a Biblical pilgrimage.</div> </div> </div> </div>No<br /> <br /> But we still love you","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T13:56:22-07:00","id":903765,"title":"","content":"Crossover Hunter/Promethean Blade Runner era.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T14:06:43-07:00","id":903769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903692#post903692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You made me interested - but I still do not see this as 1650's setting would be very folk tale - and 2E Changeling sounds much more... political one?</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, I think, Chmielnicki's uprising and the various empires trying to use the ukrainian folk to their goals, as well as the local politics amongst nobles and other groups involves should probably get that angle covered, even to a lesser extent than &quot;Lily, Sabre and Thorn&quot; or &quot;A Grimm Dark Era&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T15:01:00-07:00","id":903793,"title":"","content":"Lots.<br /> <br /> - Innocents Blitz<br /> - Hunter Book of Judges<br /> - The Oath of the Moon<br /> - Xia Vampire<br /> - Promethean Trojan War/The Oddessy <br /> - Geist in 1290-1310 Florence (aka Dante's Divine Comedy)<br /> - Mage/Vampire/Hunter Nizari Ismaili State<br /> - Wild West Geist <br /> - Rashidun Mummy <br /> - WWII everything<br /> <br /> ... This isn't even everything, just what I could pull off the top of my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 05-30-2016, 08:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T21:08:24-07:00","id":903935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903793#post903793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lots.<br /> <br /> - Innocents Blitz<br /> - Hunter Book of Judges<br /> - The Oath of the Moon<br /> - Xia Vampire<br /> - Promethean Trojan War/The Oddessy<br /> - Geist in 1290-1310 Florence (aka Dante's Divine Comedy)<br /> - Mage/Vampire/Hunter Nizari Ismaili State<br /> - Wild West Geist<br /> - Rashidun Mummy<br /> - WWII everything<br /> <br /> ... This isn't even everything, just what I could pull off the top of my head.</div> </div> </div> </div>More, more, MOAR!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T21:12:00-07:00","id":903938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inquisitor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903769#post903769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, I think, Chmielnicki's uprising and the various empires trying to use the ukrainian folk to their goals, as well as the local politics amongst nobles and other groups involves should probably get that angle covered, even to a lesser extent than &quot;Lily, Sabre and Thorn&quot; or &quot;A Grimm Dark Era&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is probably why I do not get <b>Changeling</b> as gameline - I do not treat it as political game, but folklore one. And I despise Sarmatism at large. Still, on Polish Polter portal, about 10 years ago, there were some foundations lay for this Era and stricte Poland setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T22:22:18-07:00","id":903963,"title":"","content":"I'll write up more details on the other pitches later, but the basic list I have is...<br /> <br /> VtR: Qin Dynasty - Covenants that rose of the Hundred Schools of Thought. The Legalist Covenant (which in addition to bureaucratic governance of vampires is also the culture's &quot;we are monsters who are supposed to keep humanity in line through fear&quot; faction) is beginning to enforce 'Shu' (the Masquerade) on the rest of the Kindred. The Confucian Covenant (feudal rule + serving as active &quot;ancestors&quot; with filial relationships with living family and necromantically with the passed) is fighting back HARD. With expansion incorporate in 2E &quot;Immortals&quot; with the Emperor and Taoist Alchemists seeking immortality and kindred blood as a potential key<br /> <br /> WtF: Meiji Restoration<br /> <br /> MtA: Classical Maya Decline<br /> <br /> PtC: 17th Century England, the last gasp of the once great &quot;Belenus&quot; Lineage of &quot;Wickermen&quot; (the primary fire/choleric Lineage before the Frankenstein), whose Disquiet promotes religious fervor. The last of them die (or achieve the New Dawn) in the Fire of 1666, following decades of Civil War, theocracy, and Restoration<br /> <br /> CtL: Underground Railroad (ideally expanded to allow inclusion of trods connecting similar struggles in Dahomey, Abeokuta, and Brazil)<br /> <br /> HtV: Birth of the Haudenosaunee (a new Hunter Conspiracy is born under the blessing of Hiawatha and the Peacemaker themselves, to fight to uphold the Great Law against cannibal witch-cults)<br /> <br /> GtSE: Dante's Italy (ideally expanded with &quot;Inferno&quot;, the locally accessible Underworld is being corrupted by Demons/Lemures)<br /> <br /> MtC: Height of the Inca - an era focusing on clashes between the Twice-Risen and indigenous undead outside the Arisen frame of reference (not that the Twice-Risen have a complete grasp on their own frame of reference)<br /> <br /> DtD: Wild West (Unchained head to the frontier trying to escape the Machine, but on iron rails it chases behind them)<br /> <br /> BtP: Ivan's Russia (culturally diverse groups unified as kin under the &quot;terror&quot; of a powerful Apex)<br /> <br /> Dt???: Mauryan Empire (focusing on Visha Kanya lore)<br /> <br /> Blue Line: Innocents in the Blitz<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Other potential Eras include...<br /> <br /> <br /> Werewolf: Hunting Grounds Sumer (updated to 2E and reframed as being in the window between the Sundering and the Oaths, with the Oaths on the horizon after the fall of Bau)<br /> <br /> Hunter/Mummy: Book of Judges (Akhenaten's war on the cults is pushing fleeing &quot;foreign gods&quot; into Israel)<br /> <br /> Changeling/Beast: Ulster Cycle Ireland (the Invasion Cycle plays into the LORE of this era that shapes supernatural culture)<br /> <br /> Hunter/Demon: Albigensian Cathars (including a Cathar Compact which opposes the &quot;Demiurge&quot; [God Machine], and a pre-Malleus Church Conspiracy that hunts rebel Demons)<br /> <br /> Promethean/Demon: Mansa Musa Pilgrimage (opposing omens from the God-Machine and Principle, while at the same time you have the themes of pilgrimage for the Prometheans, and building connected infrastructure for Demons)<br /> <br /> *Mage/Geist: Golden Age of Piracy<br /> <br /> *Mage/Beast: French Revolution<br /> <br /> Vampire/Hunter: Pre-Mutiny India<br /> <br /> *Vampire/Mage/Deviant: Chicago World Fair (Requiem in the White City crosses over with the experimenation of the eugenics era, as modernist Nameless and Seers of the Throne inch closer and closer together until they'll blast apart with the Great Refusal)<br /> <br /> Werewolf/Geist: Great War (five beings that may be literally the Horsemen themselves walk the earth, while the Uratha hunt the unprecedented spirits of industrial warfare in the trenches)<br /> <br /> Vampire/Beast: Jazz Age (Lovecraftian Racism &amp; the Height of Post-Civil War Racial Violence clashes with the beauty and intrigue of the Harlem Renaissance)<br /> <br /> Demon: Bleeding Edge (fully cyberpunk rules update for 2E; I know Demon is a little obvious BUT it provides this important opportunity - the God-Machine is maintaining different possible &quot;near futures&quot; simultaneously, and Demons alone have the power to move between them. So you've got your environmental disaster Earth, you're Chinese global surveillance Earth, you're warring megacorps Earth, your socio-anarchist transhumanist Earth, your Unfleshed Prometheans outnumber humanity Earth... etc etc)<br /> <br /> Mummy: Infinite Macabre (full space-opera rules update for 2E; the Fifth Turn, the Arisen cults seek Starry A'aru among the literal stars on biblical pilgrimages ala Battlestar Galactica)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> *these three eras actually have a narrative string running through their Mage elements<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> - Ok, so this is actually one era short to be the full list equal to the 26 we are getting, but I've got two ideas on that playing on very recent history... so recent they may be in bad taste. Option 1) &quot;American Werewolves in London&quot;, the 90s, Brethren War/Reclamation rage in North America, and many Forsaken take refuge in the UK, which has its own Hisil thrown into chaos with the death of Princess Diana and the rise of a new Incarna (see Shadows of the UK); 2) Changeling in 2003 Baghdad, where Djinn lore based Courts are played off against the brutal reality the past decades of Bathist rule and the &quot;shock and awe&quot; destabilizing Coalition Invasion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T23:37:33-07:00","id":903987,"title":"","content":"Please, Onyx Path, make those Era from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a> reality!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T07:55:14-07:00","id":904149,"title":"","content":"Possibly not the place for it, but I'd also be in favor of Game-line specific Dark Eras. IE. Multiple Dark Eras for Vampire in one book, same with Werewolf, Mage, etc... Overlapping the same Eras between the books would kind of be like cross-over (at least, resembling the extent of the existing cross over in Dark Eras).<br /> <br /> Not sure of the exact game-lines, but the initial colonization of Australia by Europe might be interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T08:34:59-07:00","id":904181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903963#post903963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll write up more details on the other pitches later, but the basic list I have is...<br /> Werewolf/Geist: Great War (five beings that may be literally the Horsemen themselves walk the earth, while the Uratha hunt the unprecedented spirits of industrial warfare in the trenches)<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Literally anything WWI would make me so happy. When Matt asked me what I thought the Beast Dark Era should be, I told him WWI. True story. And then I told him Reconstruction, but.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T13:38:51-07:00","id":904399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=904181#post904181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Literally anything WWI would make me so happy. When Matt asked me what I thought the Beast Dark Era should be, I told him WWI. True story. And then I told him Reconstruction, but.</div> </div> </div> </div>But Wraith: The Great War is already a masterpiece!<br /> <br /> It's a shame that Ruins of Empire felt really, really underwhelming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T21:33:41-07:00","id":904706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=904399#post904399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But Wraith: The Great War is already a masterpiece!</div> </div> </div> </div>It is! But the Werewolf/Geist Dark Era I'm imagining would really try to entrench the supernaturals in the war itself, rather than the a separate conflict of the dead that follows. Not that they'd be fighting for their countries necessarily (though they could), but they'd have to do their hunt, deal with the restless dead, on the active battlefields themselves.<br /> <br /> Also the original 5 Geists who embodied the 5 Thresholds may be lose... perhaps even bonded with Bound. The Red Horseman is in France. The Black Horseman is in Russia. The White Horseman can't sit still anywhere with the speed of the spread of influenza. And no one knows what the Grey Horseman is up to in America, but he seems very interested in Detroit. No sign of the Pale Horseman yet.<br /> <br /> Death Wolf herself is calling for the hunt of these old prey of his.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T21:53:28-07:00","id":904717,"title":"","content":"A bit more mythological, but I'm sure OP could find a way to make them work<br /> <br /> - Changeling: The Twelves Labours of Heracles <br /> - Promethean: Exodus<br /> - Hunter: Ramayana<br /> - Demon: Mahabharta","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T00:23:32-07:00","id":904767,"title":"","content":"To revive an old idea of mine: how about the Seven Years' War (focused in the American colonies moreso than elsewhere) as a Vampire/Hunter crossover Era? This is where British and French imperial, mercantile, and religious differences erupt into bloodshed, with each side not only using its armies but also hiring all sorts of former pirates and trying to win native tribes over on dubious alliances. My chronicle for this was all about Quebec and a shadow war for control of the colonies between the primarily French Sanctified and a British Invictus branch, with a unknown native covenant as a major wildcard and possible Strix involvement. <br /> <br /> Where things get really fun is when you throw in the Hunters, everything from Malleus cells an entire ocean away from their support networks and supernaturally-aware privateer crews to a possible new Native American conspiracy that may well have died off (or gone deep underground) by the modern day. <br /> <br /> The best part is it makes for a companion setting with the proposed Pirate Mage/Geist!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 06-01-2016, 11:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T05:59:25-07:00","id":904891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=904767#post904767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To revive an old idea of mine: how about the Seven Years' War (focused in the American colonies moreso than elsewhere) as a Vampire/Hunter crossover Era? This is where British and French imperial, mercantile, and religious differences erupt into bloodshed, with each side not only using its armies but also hiring all sorts of former pirates and trying to win native tribes over on dubious alliances. My chronicle for this was all about Quebec and a shadow war for control of the colonies between the primarily French Sanctified and a British Invictus branch, with a unknown native covenant as a major wildcard and possible Strix involvement.<br /> <br /> Where things get really fun is when you throw in the Hunters, everything from Malleus cells an entire ocean away from their support networks and supernaturally-aware privateer crews to a possible new Native American that may well have died off (or gone deep underground) by the modern day.<br /> <br /> The best part is it makes for a companion setting with the proposed Pirate Mage/Geist!</div> </div> </div> </div>I love the shit out of this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T07:09:17-07:00","id":904938,"title":"","content":"One of my personal favorite historical events/eras is the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiping_Rebellion\" target=\"_blank\">Taiping Rebellion</a> (1850-1864). It's a fascinating clash of antiquity and modernity, eastern and western culture, conflicting radical ideologies. It has hallmarks of a pulpy adventure setting with colorful, larger than life characters. Also tens of millions of people died horrific deaths from war, famine, and disease while the world mostly didn't notice or didn't care.<br /> <br /> I've just never been totally sure what splats would run best there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T11:51:21-07:00","id":905085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/903306-what-would-you-like-to-see-in-dark-eras-2?p=903641#post903641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm also game for both Roman Mage <i>and</i> an expansion of Hunting Ground: Sumer. But the latter might end up being covered as an extension of my Age of Azar project, and/or <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4152\" data-vbnamecard=\"4152\">Arcanist</a>'s Sundered World Chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm also working in the Vampire/Geist Spanish Civil War, but I'll need someone to help me translate it to English correctly (I'm writing them in Spanish).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}